msgctxt "444"
msgid ""
"Hey, Mack.\r\n"
"I'm here to run again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san!\r\n"
"You're getting very close to perfect!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid ""
"Well, I've done quite a bit of running, after\r\n"
"all. I don't think anyone can beat me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid "Great!"
msgstr "Ottimo!"

msgctxt "492"
msgid "In fact, I may never have to run all-out again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "There you are! I finally found you, Sugar Buns!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "528"
msgid ""
"M-Michiru! What're you doing here!?\r\n"
"I thought you and Akira got back together...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid ""
"I just couldn't get you out of my mind, darling.\r\n"
"And I guess my women's intuition led me here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid "Please give me one more memory of the two of us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid "Hey! Stay back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "Damn! I gotta get the hell outta here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid ""
"Mack!\r\n"
"I'll have to take a rain check!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid "Wait!"
msgstr "Aspetta!"

msgctxt "636"
msgid ""
"This is it!\r\n"
"You're finally pushing yourself to your limit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid "This is the perfect shot I've been waiting for!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid ""
"Are you trying to lead me to a deserted spot\r\n"
"where we can be alone? Oh, Sugar Buns...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid "Get away from me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid "Aaaaagh!"
msgstr "Aaaargh!"

msgctxt "756"
msgid "Ugh... That was terrible..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "768"
msgid ""
"Arigato, Kiryu-san!\r\n"
"Thanks to you, I was finally able to get it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "780"
msgid "What...? You mean⑬!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "792"
msgid ""
"A predator and her prey, both running with all\r\n"
"their might. It's just like I saw on the plains\r\n"
"of Africa, but right here in Kamurocho!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "804"
msgid "That was the perfect shot I've always wanted!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "816"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "828"
msgid "But now I realize I was wrong about one thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "840"
msgid ""
"This kind of struggle must be going on in cities\r\n"
"all across the world. There's more than just one\r\n"
"perfect shot out there waiting for me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "852"
msgid ""
"I'm going to keep traveling around the world in\r\n"
"search of more shots like this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "864"
msgid "Yeah, you do that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "888"
msgid ""
"You really burned my rubber out there, Kiryu-san. I knew if\r\n"
"anyone was gonna run me down, it was you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "924"
msgid ""
"I always knew you were the top dog, Kiryu-san! Here, lemme\r\n"
"slip you a little something as a reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "960"
msgid "You got <Color:8>Mack's Talisman<Color:Default>!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "984"
msgid ""
"Whoa, topping your own score? That's some serious dedication\r\n"
"if I've ever seen it, Kiryu-san! Here, take one of these babies. It'll perk you right back up in no time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1032"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Staminan XX<Color:Default>!"
msgstr "Hai ottenuto una <Color:8>Staminan XX<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "1044"
msgid "Pop on by when you wanna run again!"
