msgctxt "3000"
msgid ""
"Clear Mack's trainings to earn skills that will help you\r\n"
"in future chases. This will also unlock the next training.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Beat the records to get special items!\r\n"
"(Training B has no records, so you will\r\n"
"get an item just for clearing the course.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3012"
msgid "This one's easy-peasy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3024"
msgid ""
"We're flipping the script in this one: instead of you coming\r\n"
"for me, it'll be me biting at your ankles! Escape to win!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3036"
msgid ""
"This one's got curves for days, man! I'll warn you, catching\r\n"
"me's gonna take every last drop you got in the tank!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3048"
msgid "You ready to see my final form, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3060"
msgid "Hit me up here if you want the deets on how this all works."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3072"
msgid "What, you tired of talking to little old me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3084"
msgid "Smell ya later, Kiryu-san! I'll be here when you come back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3096"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san! Just the guy I wanted to see! And, conveniently\r\n"
"one of the only dudes who even knows about this place!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3108"
msgid "...Yeah. Here I am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3120"
msgid ""
"Well without further ado, it's time you get acquainted with\r\n"
"that friend I was telling you about!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3132"
msgid "Come on out here, Okuda-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3156"
msgid "Hey, Mack. This the guy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3168"
msgid "Hold on a second. You're one of Majima's men, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3180"
msgid "I, er... Oh, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3192"
msgid ""
"Mack said his new pal was a tough cookie, but I would never\r\n"
"have guessed it'd be you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3204"
msgid ""
"Anyway, the name's Okuda. I supervise the construction\r\n"
"around here... though as you can see there hasn't been much of that going on of late."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3216"
msgid "Hold up, you two know each other!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3228"
msgid "Oh, er, Mack... This guy, he's the Dr⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3240"
msgid "You can stop right there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3252"
msgid "Of course, sir!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3264"
msgid ""
"Man, I just knew you two'd get along like peas in a pod!\r\n"
"Heck, you're practically wearing the same threads, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3276"
msgid "Heh, always the optimist. So, what are we doing here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3288"
msgid "The whole place looks kinda..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3312"
msgid "Empty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3324"
msgid "Maybe for now! Bring it out, Okuda-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3336"
msgid "Aye aye, Mack!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3348"
msgid "Training Formation A, move out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3372"
msgid "Yes, sir!"
msgstr "Sì, signore!"

msgctxt "3408"
msgid "So, Kiryu-san? Is it everything you ever hoped and dreamed?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3420"
msgid "I... don't know what to say. It's incredible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3432"
msgid ""
"All for Mack and his perfect shot. My boys have been working\r\n"
"their routines, trying to get the set-up juuust right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3444"
msgid "I had no idea you'd be lending a hand with this, too, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3456"
msgid ""
"It hit me like a flash of lightning to the skull when I saw the way you run,"
" Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3468"
msgid ""
"It was like... I dunno why, but it felt like you were gonna\r\n"
"be my one-way ticket to that perfect shot I've been after."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3480"
msgid ""
"Sooo you mind running some more? Y'know, get the camera\r\n"
"juices flowing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3492"
msgid ""
"I guess it couldn't hurt. In this town you never know when\r\n"
"you might need to chase someone down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3504"
msgid "Am I just gonna be running by myself, though?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3516"
msgid "There's the ten billion yen question!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3552"
msgid ""
"The thick and thin of it is, Kiryu-san, I'm gonna be run run running away, "
"and I want you to catch catch catch me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3564"
msgid "You sure? I'm pretty fast, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3576"
msgid ""
"Pfft, no problem at all! I used to live out among a herd of\r\n"
"gazelle on the African plains... and my being here is proof\r\n"
"enough that I outran every lion I ever came across!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3588"
msgid "That's... an interesting way to train."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3600"
msgid "Anyway, sure. I'll help you get this perfect shot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3612"
msgid ""
"You will!? Thank you! Oh, thank you, Kiryu-san! Just gimme\r\n"
"a holler when you wanna run!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3624"
msgid ""
"If you beat me, I'll teach you some of the most esoteric\r\n"
"secrets I learned in my world travels!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3636"
msgid ""
"Heh, I can't think of a better reward. Looking forward to\r\n"
"it, Mack."
msgstr ""

